<introText>
You decide to go on a stroll through town. While inspecting the window display of a jeweller, a pleasant smell of fresh baked goods catches your nose. You turn around and see a man walking past while eating a sausage roll. 
You purposefully set out down the street, hunting for the source of this tasty treat. You come across a Greggs bakery around the corner. Perhaps time for a snack? 
</introText>



<sceneDescriptionText>
