<buySteakBakeText>
You emerge with a crispy steak bake. Biting carefully into it, you find that the filling is just the perfect temperature. In moments, the steak bake is no more and your stomach is pleasantly full.
</buySteakBakeText>

<buyNothingText>
What kind of a $w.girlOrWoman would you be if you just grabbed baked goods on a whim!? Aside from the sort of $w.girlOrWoman who's eating a sausage roll, of course. 

Rejecting the bakery's temptation, you continue on your way.
</buyNothingText>

